{"metadata":{"kernelspec":{"language":"python","display_name":"Python 3","name":"python3"},"language_info":{"name":"python","version":"3.12.12","mimetype":"text/x-python","codemirror_mode":{"name":"ipython","version":3},"pygments_lexer":"ipython3","nbconvert_exporter":"python","file_extension":".py"},"kaggle":{"accelerator":"none","dataSources":[{"sourceId":14609409,"sourceType":"datasetVersion","datasetId":9322198},{"sourceId":14610443,"sourceType":"datasetVersion","datasetId":9331224}],"dockerImageVersionId":31260,"isInternetEnabled":true,"language":"python","sourceType":"notebook","isGpuEnabled":false}},"nbformat_minor":4,"nbformat":4,"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"# 🛠️ 环境准备与权限校验 (Environment Setup & Verification)\n\n本阶段已完成工作空间初始化，并确保所有核心脚本具备执行权限。\n\n### 1. 文件完整性检查\n通过 `ls` 校验，确认以下核心组件已就绪：\n*   **Python 脚本**: `preprocess_data.py`, `monitor_training.py`, `test_inference.py`\n*   **配置中心**: `train_config.yaml`, `export_config.yaml`\n*   **说明文档**: `README.md`, `FILE_LIST.md`\n\n### 2. 权限自动化配置\n已通过 `os.stat` 模块对 Shell 脚本批量授予执行权限（Executable Permissions）：\n*   `setup.sh` (环境安装)\n*   `train.sh` (训练主程序)\n*   `run_all.sh` (全流程自动化)\n*   `cleanup.sh` & `export_and_quantize.sh`\n\n> **验证状态**: ✅ `rwxr-xr-x` 权限已生效。\n\n### 3. 结果汇总\n目前 `/kaggle/working` 目录已达到训练就绪状态（Ready-to-Train）。\n*注意：由于尚未生成模型，目前目录不含 `.json` 配置文件。*\n### 4. 环境依赖部署 (Dependency Deployment)\n已执行 `setup.sh` 脚本，完成以下初始化任务：\n*   **依赖安装**：根据 `requirements.txt` 配置 Python 运行环境。\n*   **路径初始化**：建立训练所需的临时目录和输出目录。\n*   **环境验证**：底层驱动与核心库（如 CUDA/PyTorch）适配完成。\n\n> **状态更新**：🚀 系统依赖已安装，环境已切换至“训练待命”模式。\n","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"import shutil\nimport os\n\n# 修正后的源目录和目标路径\nsrc = '/kaggle/input/imppppp' \ndst = '/kaggle/working/'\n\n# 将所有文件复制到 working 目录并赋予执行权限\nif os.path.exists(src):\n    for item in os.listdir(src):\n        s = os.path.join(src, item)\n        d = os.path.join(dst, item)\n        # 避免复制文件夹（如果是文件夹需用 copytree）\n        if os.path.isfile(s):\n            shutil.copy2(s, d)\n            # 如果是脚本，赋予执行权限\n            if item.endswith('.sh'):\n                os.chmod(d, 0o755)\n    print(\"✅ 脚本已成功迁移至 /kaggle/working 并配置执行权限\")\nelse:\n    print(f\"❌ 找不到源目录: {src}，请检查 Dataset 名称是否正确\")","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-01-25T07:58:54.051837Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-01-25T07:58:54.052057Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-01-25T07:58:54.141132Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-01-25T07:58:54.052034Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-01-25T07:58:54.140593Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"✅ 脚本已成功迁移至 /kaggle/working 并配置执行权限\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":1},{"cell_type":"code","source":"!cat /kaggle/working/train_config.yaml","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-01-25T07:57:05.542324Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-01-25T07:57:05.542686Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-01-25T07:57:05.661850Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-01-25T07:57:05.542650Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-01-25T07:57:05.660755Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"### ============================================================\n### 正式训练配置 (T4×2 GPU - 彻底修复训练跳过版)\n### ============================================================\n\n### 模型配置\nmodel_name_or_path: Qwen/Qwen2-VL-7B-Instruct\ntemplate: qwen2_vl\ndo_train: true                # <--- 关键修复：强制开启训练模式\nquantization_bit: 4 \nquantization_type: nf4\ndouble_quantization: true\n\n### 数据配置\ndataset: rehab_train\nval_size: 0.0                 # <--- 建议先设为 0，防止它跑去 eval\ncutoff_len: 1024              # 降低 cutoff 确保双卡绝对不 OOM\nmax_samples: 1000\npreprocessing_num_workers: 2\n\n### LoRA 配置\nfinetuning_type: lora\nlora_rank: 16\nlora_alpha: 32\nlora_dropout: 0.05\nlora_target: all\ncreate_new_adapter: false\n\n### 训练参数\nnum_train_epochs: 3\nlearning_rate: 1.0e-4\nlr_scheduler_type: cosine\nwarmup_ratio: 0.1\nweight_decay: 0.01\nmax_grad_norm: 1.0\n\n### 显存优化策略\nper_device_train_batch_size: 1\ngradient_accumulation_steps: 8 # 稍微减小，让日志刷新快一点\ngradient_checkpointing: true\nbf16: false\nfp16: true\noptim: adamw_8bit\nddp_find_unused_parameters: false\n\n### 评估与保存配置（已简化以确保训练启动）\neval_strategy: \"no\"           # <--- 关键修复：关闭评估，防止跳过训练\nsave_strategy: steps\nsave_steps: 100\nload_best_model_at_end: false\n\n### 视觉 token 限制\nvllm_maxlen: 1024\n\n### 输出与监控\noutput_dir: /kaggle/working/rehab_lora\nsave_total_limit: 1\nlogging_steps: 1              # <--- 改为 1，确保你能立刻看到进度\noverwrite_output_dir: true\nddp_timeout: 7200\nreport_to: none\nsave_safetensors: true\n\n### 其他优化\nseed: 42\ndata_seed: 42\ndataloader_num_workers: 2\ndataloader_pin_memory: false\ntorch_compile: false","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":4},{"cell_type":"code","source":"!bash /kaggle/working/setup.sh","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-01-25T07:59:05.318836Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-01-25T07:59:05.319506Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-01-25T07:59:33.651157Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-01-25T07:59:05.319474Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-01-25T07:59:33.650443Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"==========================================\n环境初始化开始 (T4×2 GPU 配置)\n==========================================\n[1/6] 配置环境变量...\n✓ 环境变量配置完成\n[2/6] 检查 GPU 配置...\n检测到 2 个 GPU\nGPU 型号: Tesla T4\n✓ 检测到 T4 GPU，配置已优化\n✓ 双卡配置，将使用 DDP 训练\n✓ GPU 检查完成\n[3/6] 安装 LLaMA-Factory...\n  Installing build dependencies ... \u001b[?25l\u001b[?25hdone\n  Checking if build backend supports build_editable ... \u001b[?25l\u001b[?25hdone\n  Getting requirements to build editable ... \u001b[?25l\u001b[?25hdone\n  Installing backend dependencies ... \u001b[?25l\u001b[?25hdone\n  Preparing editable metadata (pyproject.toml) ... \u001b[?25l\u001b[?25hdone\n\u001b[2K     \u001b[90m━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\u001b[0m \u001b[32m43.3/43.3 kB\u001b[0m \u001b[31m3.4 MB/s\u001b[0m eta \u001b[36m0:00:00\u001b[0m\n\u001b[?25h\u001b[33mWARNING: llamafactory 0.9.5.dev0 does not provide the extra 'metrics'\u001b[0m\u001b[33m\n\u001b[0m\u001b[33mWARNING: 